<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoogovens up after full-year results.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens up after full-year results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch steel and aluminium group Hoogovens NV jumped seven guilders to 98.00 in early trade on Thursday after the company announced net profits for 1996 above market expectations.</p>
<p>Hoogovens said full-year net profit was 326 million guilders, down from 1995's 507 million, but exceeding the analysts' forecast range of a net from ordinary operations of between 260 and 310 million guilders.</p>
<p>The company also said it expected to see its net from ordinary operations improve during 1997.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
